To clear the only blocker, explicitly permit a coordinated version bump in:

- pyproject.toml
- src/axiom_encode/__init__.py
- uv.lock

Then rerun the provenance guard and the full suite. Without that scope exception
or an explicit maintainer override recorded for the PR, the branch must remain
not-ready and must not be merged.

